      "updated_at": "2019-05-27T08:23:54Z",
      "body": "I don't understand why do you think the actual behaviour is wrong. What you're describing as \"expected behaviour\" is totally unexpected. When I leave the app in the private mode why should a link be opened in the non-private mode? I would call this a privacy violation. It's my explicit choice to either use the private or the regular mode and I expect that Fenix remembers my choice… 😳",
