      "body": "It's intended behavior – I agree though that it could be more explicit by giving people the option to open a link in a normal tab if they want to w/o having to make them do any inconvenient workarounds to get the site into normal mode. Also the other way around, if I leave FF Preview in normal mode, tap on a link and would rather be in private mode is worth to consider. @vesta0 can we track this as part of https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/419",
